{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23445","headline":"雪中即事荅微之 · 白居易","name":"雪中即事荅微之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"连夜江云黄惨澹，平明山雪白馍糊。\n银河沙涨三千里，梅岭花排一万株。\n北市风生飘散麪，东楼日出照凝酥。\n谁家高士关门户，何处行人失道途？\n舞鹤庭前毛稍定，捣衣碪上练新铺。\n戏团稚女呵红手，愁坐衰翁对白须。\n压瘴一州除疾苦，呈丰万井尽欢娱。\n润含玉德怀君子，寒助霜威忆大夫。\n莫道烟波一水隔，何妨气候两乡殊。\n越中地暖多成雨，还有瑶台琼树无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23445.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23445","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}